# Brand kit (v3) — a local working folder, not published. BRAND.md carries
# internal strategy notes and the generated assets are large; rebuild them with
# brand-kit/tools/build_kit.py. See CLAUDE.md for the rules that do apply.
#
# One exception: brand.json stays tracked. The site imports it (Signet draws the
# Merge Y from it) and `npm run brand:check` reads its palette, so a deploy
# fails without it. It holds only public facts: name, links, colours, geometry.
brand-kit/*
!brand-kit/brand.json

# Brand discovery notes for AI tools: private positioning answers. Local only.
.agents/

# Retired v2.4 kit, kept out of the repo if it is ever restored locally.
v5/

